# Classroom dashboard design palette

**Scope:** This file lives in this repository’s `.cursor/rules/` only. Cursor loads it when this workspace (classroom-dashboard) is open; it is not a user-global rule.

**Intent:** Simple, low-fatigue UI — warm neutrals, one brown accent, minimal chrome. Match `classroom_curved_rows.html`; prefer whitespace over borders; cards only for interactive or grouped blocks; semantic HTML, AA contrast, visible focus.

## Tokens (use variables, not one-off hex for the same role)

- `--bg` `#F5F2EC` · `--panel-bg` `#FDFAF5` · `--border` `#D9D3C7` · `--text` `#2A2218` · `--muted` `#7A7060`
- `--accent` `#8B5E3C` · `--accent-l` `#C49A6C` · `--tag` `#EDE8DF` · `--shadow` `rgba(60,40,20,.10)` (e.g. `0 2px 8px`)
- **Type:** `--fh` = Georgia / Times, serif (titles, uppercase section labels + letter-spacing). `--fb` = Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial, sans-serif (body, controls).

## Status / canvas (legends, maps, canvas)

Occupied `#4A9070` / `#1D6045`; empty/neutral `#E8D5C0` strokes `#5A3E28`–`#8B5E3C`; pathway `#E0D8CC` strokes `#B0A898`/`#C0B8A8`; stairs `#C8BEAC` `#8B7355` `#D4C8B4`; destructive `#C0604A` hover `#FFE8E4`; workspace `#EAE5DC` dot `#C4BBAC` (subtle).

## Shape

Panels `border-radius: 8px`, `1px solid var(--border)`. Small controls `4px`–`6px`. No purple/blue SaaS defaults or loud gradients. Range inputs: `accent-color: var(--accent)`.

```css
/* ✅ GOOD */
.panel {
  background: var(--panel-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--shadow);
}
```
